{"resourceIdentifier":"2605","resourceName":"İZMIR LANDFILL GAS (LFG) CAPTURE AND UTILIZATION PROJECT","description":"In order to develop a municipal solid waste management system that will be environmentally friendly and sustainable, İzmir Harmandalı Solid Waste Disposal Site (SWDS) Rehabilitation and Landfill Gas (LFG) Capture and Utilization Project is being implemented by İzmir Novtek Enerji Elektrik Üretim A.Ş.    \r\n\r\nThe proposed project activity is a Methane Gas Power Generating Plant and Mechanical Sorting Facility with the installed capacity of “39.690 MWe”. The project is built within the structure of Harmandalı Solid Waste Landfill Facility in İzmir province, as the third-largest SWDS in Turkey, and will be operated as integrated with the currently installed units. \r\n\r\nIt is planned to rehabilitate the İzmir Harmandalı SWDS that receives around 4,500 tons of municipal waste coming from 23 different districts of İzmir province daily and to generate renewable electric power by capturing and utilizing landfill gas.\r\n\r\nWhilst providing sustainable development benefits to the host communities and the host country, the proposed project activity will reduce greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions mainly by \r\n\r\n•\tpreventing GHG emissions, methane in particular, from being emitted directly to the atmosphere from waste at the Harmandalı SWDS that would be otherwise left to be decomposed;\r\n•\treplacing the electricity that would have otherwise been generated by the national grid which is heavily dependent on fossil-fuel-based resources, through generating renewable energy and feeding it to the grid.\r\n\r\nThe project has begun to generate electricity on October 29th, 2019, which is regarded as the project start date. \r\n\r\nThis project adopts a fixed crediting period of 10 years. The expected average annual emission reductions are 618,042 tCO2eq/y. Accordingly, the project is expected to generate 6,180,420 tCO2eq emissions reduction throughout its first crediting period. \r\n\r\nFor further information on the project, please see the informative video below:\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hl36alapiQg&t=124s","location":{"latitude":38.532753,"longitude":27.074458},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-03-25","endExclusive":"2022-04-25","endInclusive":"2022-04-24"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2605"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Harmandalı Gazi Mustafa Kemal Atatürk Quarter"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2605"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"618042"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"TÜV SÜD South Asia Private Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"26/10/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 25/10/2019 - 24/10/2026"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=55648&IDKEY=ulksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098n76738592","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-V4.1-D0zmir Landfill Gas (LFG) Capture and Utilization Project-Rev01-(ID2605)-200821.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-09-14T19:27:14.08Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=55534&IDKEY=r8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfu